ng to get in and people"], [25.96, 27.074, "trying to get out."], [27.852, 29.037, "His line in the sand:"], [29.269, 31.521, "if it fell to $71 or"], [31.881, 34.505, "$72, it would start to get interesting for"], [34.574, 34.865, "him."], [36.107, 36.966, "Here's what happened."], [37.128, 40.739, "Anthropic opened around $111 and closed its first"], [40.786, 42.434, "day near $97."], [42.864, 44.327, "Four trading days later,"], [44.408, 46.219, "it fell below $83."], [46.579, 48.773, "By Wednesday, it was near $79,"], [48.843, 50.886, "closing in on his $77."], [51.246, 52.268, "But even at his number,"], [52.291, 53.603, "he wasn't rushing to buy."], [53.917, 55.148, "It needs to drop a lot,"], [55.182, 57.586, "he said. And the reason has nothing to"], [57.667, 58.7, "do with AI."]]}, "S03": {"frames": 2177, "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.313], ["three.", 0.348, 0.882], ["Designed", 1.242, 1.753], ["in", 1.788, 1.858], ["hell.", 1.939, 2.438], ["Most", 3.007, 3.332], ["tech", 3.402, 3.622], ["founders", 3.704, 4.11], ["keep", 4.191, 4.365], ["control", 4.435, 4.783], ["with", 4.853, 4.969], ["special", 4.992, 5.352], ["voting", 5.422, 5.724], ["shares.", 5.77, 6.304], ["Anthropic", 6.734, 7.314], ["went", 7.361, 7.512], ["further.", 7.581, 8.104], ["Damodaran", 8.464, 9.091], ["describes", 9.137, 9.578], ["a", 9.625, 9.648], ["single", 9.718, 10.043], ["founder", 10.077, 10.391], ["share,", 10.437, 10.913], ["held", 11.227, 11.459], ["by", 11.494, 11.61], ["seven", 11.703, 11.993], ["founders,", 12.063, 12.643], ["carrying", 12.875, 13.247], ["50.01%", 13.351, 14.814], ["of", 14.907, 14.954], ["the", 14.977, 15.047], ["votes.", 15.081, 15.569], ["He", 16.057, 16.208], ["calls", 16.277, 16.591], ["the", 16.637, 16.718], ["structure", 16.764, 17.357], ["one", 17.461, 17.751], ["designed", 17.798, 18.239], ["in", 18.274, 18.343], ["hell", 18.436, 18.622], ["for", 18.692, 18.796], ["shareholders.", 18.843, 19.644], ["His", 20.131, 20.329], ["comparison:", 20.398, 21.37