n is,"], [22.21, 23.22, "in his words,"], [23.336, 25.286, "the optimist hat firmly on."], [25.623, 27.864, "He'd consider Anthropic at a discount,"], [28.119, 30.256, "as one company in a portfolio."], [30.882, 32.09, "Never as a big bet."], [32.427, 34.481, "The same rule applies to Nvidia."], [34.771, 37.407, "He sold the shares he bought in 2018,"], [37.72, 39.299, "but he has a limit order to buy"], [39.404, 41.598, "back at $140."], [42.086, 44.779, "He thought the CEO question mattered less than"], [44.826, 45.87, "the China question."], [46.3, 48.587, "And he thought Jensen Huang was unlikely to"], [48.634, 49.33, "come back."], [50.108, 51.014, "Five days later,"], [51.049, 52.976, "Nvidia's board reinstated him,"], [53.208, 55.727, "a reminder that even the best valuation is"], [55.774, 56.575, "a forecast."], [57.005, 58.224, "His rule for both:"], [58.584, 61.637, "concentrating your portfolio in one AI stock is"], [61.707, 62.461, "deadly."]]}, "S06": {"frames": 1902, "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.372], ["six.", 0.464, 1.103], ["What", 1.463, 1.672], ["it", 1.707, 1.776], ["means", 1.846, 2.055], ["for", 2.125, 2.229], ["you.", 2.31, 2.694], ["Ed", 3.599, 3.773], ["Elson", 3.843, 4.18], ["says", 4.272, 4.551], ["that", 4.598, 4.714], ["for", 4.748, 4.865], ["AI", 4.957, 5.317], ["stocks,", 5.422, 5.921], ["the", 5.956, 6.037], ["bubble", 6.107, 6.374], ["has", 6.409, 6.56], ["already", 6.629, 6.954], ["popped.", 7.001, 7.512], ["Damodaran", 7.941, 8.626], ["is", 8.696, 8.777], ["more", 8.858, 9.021], ["struck", 9.044, 9.288], ["by", 9.358, 9.427], ["the", 9.474, 9.543], ["rest", 9.613, 9.787], ["of", 9.834, 9.88], ["the", 9.915, 9.985], ["market,", 10.031, 10.577], ["which", 10.739, 10.948], ["held", 11.018, 11.273], ["up", 11.343, 11.482], ["as", 11.552, 11.656], ["AI", 11.738, 12.19], ["and", 12.26, 12.411], ["tech", 12.481, 12.678], ["fell.", 12.748, 13.247], ["He", 13.816, 13.955], ["thinks", 14.025, 14.234], ["we're", 14.269, 14.408], ["closer", 14.443